function tokenizedLine(line){const rex=/(\/\/.*$)|("(?:\\.|[^"\\])*"|'(?:\\.|[^'\\])*')|\b(const|export|import|from|async|await|return|if|throw|new|function|type|interface|describe|it|expect|class|try|catch|void|boolean|number|string)\b|\b([A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*)\b|\b(\d+)\b/g;let result='',last=0,m;while((m=rex.exec(line))){result+=esc(line.slice(last,m.index));const cls=m[1]?'comment':m[2]?'string':m[3]?'keyword':m[4]?'type':'number';result+=`<span class="tk-${cls}">${esc(m[0])}</span>`;last=rex.lastIndex}return result+esc(line.slice(last))}
